{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1323f1ce4bf72484ae348d12823a4f1156f7601ac42d40f28f203bdb24d9042f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8dc195b3a973c7e3fc172d7044e3a97de67b0d8feaf28e2660e64b6992b8493",
      "text": "……但是这件事情，也很难\n进展得很顺利呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f24cef61684806c01e8744d29253761e84c7108c9ac9a0ff3c434b8ef087dff4",
      "text": "是这样吗？\n明明是这么有趣的话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85bb825b3be4c2f8afca5fc7085d5cb06fa1cb924da997e0b5b5219b8e82f58f",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n只是，问题不在于海洋，而在于我自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c98bb2e47007e3294daf80d3971ec99a6ff9f9f887c5e5c851d7921f4c9a7f2",
      "text": "也就是说，我这个人，\n很不擅长与他人沟通……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8a2f0491135113fc51cc449048db8033d08fe5cd1ee6902b1596ed3c86da10b",
      "text": "虽说因为对大海的热爱，\n最终走到了今天这份工作，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08d085f37b5d884978384c7e589bc3fd8d35e0977cf767f15adb664c609f097e",
      "text": "但本就不擅长言辞，\n连深爱的大海的魅力都无法传达……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec1fafd89fa1f9d244d5d5ac77d12a16f5fba587fe03d5fbfb9a735bf2421088",
      "text": "即使如此也无论如何希望能引起大家的兴趣，\n这才制作了这张海报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba79ecb7bb296fca94ef29736acacf34bb487cac3118180317979d1965bf3777",
      "text": "原来是这样啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38dcfe88c42b0f155952d137fb5c1f441e73e2c878495491f59bb82636843726",
      "text": "所以，您能对此产生兴趣，\n我感到非常高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef58cd46f6270dcee99f46659f4e5d26a862d1c4d44fed8898224591bdd06965",
      "text": "能这么愉快地交谈，已经很久没有过了。\n请务必让我向您道谢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9643c472913fa1ebb5de6182710aa731374bd30d6b3f0db9151ab86cb62c20a",
      "text": "……这边这边！\n看啊，好像是偶像的试镜哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
